# The Government CA (Ban Cơ yếu Chính phủ) that issued the tax authority's pinned certificates in tax-authority.crt
# (#951). Read only by apps/extract/test/einvoice-trust.test.ts, which checks that every pinned certificate was issued
# by the sub-CA below and the sub-CA by the root. Never a trust anchor for invoice signatures: the Government CA issues
# certificates to many state bodies, so a chain to it proves nothing about the tax authority.
# Source: the CA store of the tax authority's iTaxViewer 2.7.3 (see README.md); the SHA-256 lines are still to be
# confirmed against https://ca.gov.vn.

